  <attributes>
    <entry>
      <string>Description</string>
      <string>Exercise 2 in a single file: 3-bit unsigned to 4-bit two's complement.
-X = ~X + 1. Zero-extend, invert, then the full 4-bit successor (NOT + three half adders) is drawn with gates in this same circuit. No other .dig file is required.</string>
    </entry>
    <entry>
      <string>shapeType</string>
      <shapeType>CUSTOM</shapeType>
    </entry>
